<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.3 Case Studies ‣ 5 Results ‣ Astra: A Multi-Agent System for GPU Kernel Performance Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Kernel 3: <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">silu_and_mul</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Astra: A Multi-Agent System for GPU Kernel Performance Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussion</span></a>
